+# Accounts
+
+This context manages customer bank accounts and the staff workflows around them.
+
+## Language
+
+**Account status**:
+The lifecycle state of an account: `OPEN` means it is active, while `CLOSED` means it is no longer active.
+
+**Status filter**:
+A request constraint that selects accounts with one specified account status from the accounts the caller is already allowed to see.
+_Avoid_: visibility filter
